; Reported, and reported once — from the lowered form, because the gate
; no longer declines and `(box …)` lowered away. Before the fix the same
; diagnostic arrived at [box-normal unioned] instead: the hook was skipped and
; the source form validated as authored. Either way the author hears
; about `t`; the path is what says which pass answered.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code union_no_branch_matched :path [box-normal unioned]))
